=== intro

A branching scene with multiple passages and complex effects.

You stand at a crossroads.

* [Go left] { crew.engineering }
  ~ fuel -= 5
  ~ flag went_left
  -> left_path

* [Go right]
  ~ flag went_right
  -> right_path

* [Stay put]
  ~ morale -= 3
  ~ chronicle "Indecision"
    Couldn't make up our minds. Time wasted.
  -> END

=== left_path

The left path leads to a workshop.

* [Search the workshop]
  ~ addCard cargo_salvage
  ~ credits += 25
  ~ chronicle "Workshop Discovery"
    Found some useful salvage in an abandoned workshop.
  -> END

* [Leave quickly]
  -> END

=== right_path

The right path leads to a marketplace.

* [Trade goods]
  ~ credits += 50
  ~ supplies -= 5
  -> END

* [Ask for information]
  ~ credits -= 10
  ~ flag got_info
  -> END
